WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.459
Depth-three circuits, beyond the square root.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.833
Three layers of gates. Lower bounds were

3
00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:06.567
stuck at two to the root n.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.144
Each middle gate covers few inputs, so

5
00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:12.896
few gates cannot cover them all.

6
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.016
Claimed: more than that, for one task.

7
